<title>USA: Supergen buys rights to Immunex's etoposide.</title>
<headline>Supergen buys rights to Immunex's etoposide.</headline>
<dateline>EMERYVILLE, Calif. 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>SuperGen Inc said on Thursday it bought the rights to Immunex Corp's generic version of the anticancer drug etoposide.</p>
<p>The terms were not disclosed. The purchase includes the rights to Immunex's form of the drug, cleared by the U.S. Food and Drug Administration in 1996, as well as Immunex's inventory of the product.</p>
